=2 Walkthrough
* Note that **the following fight is considerably more difficult** than the content leading up to it. If solo (with {p:trusts|Trust}), you may want to reach **at least level 80** before attempting.

* Examining the **???** again will immediately spawn a battle with {p:Siren|Siren (NM)}.
** Prepare (buff/summon trusts) **before** examining the **???**.
** {p:Siren|Siren (NM)} will despawn after approximately 15 minutes, ending the fight. You will need to **kill her within 15 minutes** to receive credit.
** Can {p:Charm}, which will despawn your {p:trusts|Trust} if it hits you. Charm has no effect if it hits your trusts, so let one of them tank her. (Item Level 119 players should have no issues soloing her even if they do get charmed.)
** Uses {s:Massacre Elegy} and {s:Wind Threnody II}.
** Absorbs {p:Wind} Elemental damage, including that from Skillchains such as {p:Detonation} or {p:Fragmentation}.
*** Take care when using Trusts such as {i:Cipher: Shantotto II|Cipher: Shantotto II|10187}, as their AI is designed to target the foe's greatest Elemental weakness, however in cases where foes will completely Absorb an Element, the AI will instead target that element to heal the foe.
* After the fight, examine the **???** again for another cutscene.
** You will be rewarded with {@k} {k:"Rhapsody in Azure"}.
** If you "Call for Help" on Siren, you won't get the cutscene and will have to wait 1 minute to pop again.
** In the event of death, one may rezone and still receive the cutscene as long as {p:Siren|Siren (NM)} is defeated.

